{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"はーい今日も能條愛未だよーっ。えい！キャッチ！ういぃーー。シャッキー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/05/05/6116484/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プリンシパル、昨日今日と来てくださった皆様、ありがとうございました!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わたくしのこれまでやった役は、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の昼公演は、女中2。\n夜公演は、女中1。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、今日の昼公演は、明田川太郎。\n夜公演は、女中4をやらせていただきました！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しいことに毎回2幕に出させていただけて幸せです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして大好きな明田川役もまた演じることが出来て本当嬉しかった❤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"イケメンだった...カナ？？？笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも...もっといろんな役に挑戦したいですよね。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"男役じゃない女性の役がやってみたいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"完全に明田川をやる時のくせで、女性を演じようとしても声が少し低くなってしまいます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/05/05/6116484/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぐぐぐ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いかん。いかん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家ついたら特訓だ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オッス！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さーて、明日はなんの役に立候補しようかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......とか言いつつもうやりたい役はもう決まってます(^_-)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は挑戦し続けますよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えっへへ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2013/05/05/6116484/0002.jpeg","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}